/E (March brought a fresh start to campus as the new semester got underway and students returned to their classrooms and campus routines. Alongside lectures and academic work, the month was filled with new ideas, innovation, visits, sporting activities, and opportunities to connect with the wider community. From the RISE 4.0 Hackathon and the growing group of innovation teams to the first steps towards the JENGA Centre for Innovation & Entrepreneurship, March was a month of fresh energy and new beginnings at IIT Madras Zanzibar.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
